  "details": "A deafen option would be a great addition to the VRCPlayerAPI.\n\nTo be applied locally to a performer on a stage for performances for example, so that the crowd chatter doesn't disturb them, and the crowd can continue to talk normally to each other.\n\nWhile we could set voice distance to 0 for all players except local, that would cause issues with later joiners while the performer was already on the stage and in the collider.",
